        <body>
            <div xml:id="d693">

                <pb facs="0756" n="652" sameAs="frus:frus1932v03/pg652"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.711/74: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China (Johnson) to the Secretary of
                            State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-03-31T13:00:00+08:00">March 31, 1932—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received March 31—6:24 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>394. Following from American Consul General, Mukden: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Japanese <hi rendition="#italic">gendarmerie</hi> have begun censoring
                            mail matter in the <pb facs="0757" n="653" xml:id="pg653"/> Chinese post
                            office—so far only Chinese newspapers—addressed to local foreigners,
                            several papers for Americans having been detained. Request instructions
                            regarding filing protest with the Japanese Consulate General.</p>
                        <p>Information has been received from Antung that Chinese Deputy Postal
                            Commissioner, Antung, was arrested by the Japanese <hi
                                rendition="#italic">gendarmerie</hi> and held 9 hours, his office
                            and residence being thoroughly searched, no other
                    details.”</p></quote></p>
                <p>Legation proposes to instruct Myers to
                    protest informally to Japanese Consul General if detention continues.</p>
                <closer>For the Minister:<lb/><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Perkins</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
